retrieval_date: 2026-06-14
format: DICOM VL Whole Slide Microscopy (5-instance pyramid, HTJ2K)
scanner: 3DHISTECH Kft. Pannoramic 1000
license_spdx: CC0-1.0
license_file: 3DHISTECH-HTJ2K.LICENSE
instances: 5 (000010.dcm .. 000014.dcm); per-instance SHA-256 in manifest.json
citation: |
  Small-region (1792x1888 L0) 3DHISTECH Pannoramic 1000 whole-slide microscopy
  sample, the HTJ2K (High-Throughput JPEG 2000) codec variant of the companion
  3DHISTECH-JP2K fixture. Both are CC0 derivatives of the 3DHISTECH DICOM
  datasets in the openslide-testdata DICOM corpus
  (https://openslide.cs.cmu.edu/download/openslide-testdata/DICOM/, listed CC0).
  Curated into the opentile-go / wsitools test pool to exercise the HTJ2K
  decode path; CC0 carries to derivatives.
